{"title": "[花邊] SGA：你必須始終尊重比賽", "author": "SeanLi1013 (TrunksHOPE)", "board": "", "date": "Fri Oct 23 12:59:25 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1792731568.A.903.html", "body": "https://x.com/brandonrahbar/status/2113492906313130471\n\nSGA on checking himself out despite being 3 points away from keeping his histo\nric 20 point streak going:\n\n“I was gonna go out there. And then I saw that they had subbed. So I thought\nwe should sub too. You always treat the game with respect.”\n\nSGA談到自己選擇提前退場，儘管他距離延續連續每場至少拿下20分的歷史紀錄，只差3分\n：\n\n「我本來打算上場的，但接著我看到對方已經換下球員了，所以我想，我們也應該換人。\n\n你必須始終尊重比賽。」\n\n同場加映\n\nhttps://x.com/brandonrahbar/status/2113489630330830909\n\nMark Daigneault says SGA asked to be checked out of the game even though he co\nuld've gone for 20 points to keep his streak alive.\n\n\"I just have to note, he asked out of the game at the end of the game. The cla\nss that it shows and the perspective it shows. That was his substitution.\n\nOf all the things I admire about him, that's up at the top of the list.\"\n\n雷霆隊總教練Mark Daigneault表示，即使SGA只要再次拿到20分就能延續個人連續得分紀\n錄，他仍主動要求在比賽結束前被換下場。\n\n「我只想特別指出，在比賽接近尾聲時，是他主動要求下場的。他所展現出的風度，以及\n\n他看待事情的格局，都令人敬佩。那次換人是他自己提出的。\n\n在我欣賞他的所有特質當中，這一點絕對名列前茅。」\n\n———\n\n不刷就是帥！", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "joy2105feh", "content": "得體領袖", "time": "10/23 12:59"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "bbs0840738", "content": "選擇不刷 令人尊重", "time": "10/23 13:00"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "largan6075", "content": "大哥", "time": "10/23 13:00"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "nsbgm", "content": "可以", "time": "10/23 13:00"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ClownT", "content": "那誰不尊重？", "time": "10/23 13:01"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "q210216", "content": "反觀XD", "time": "10/23 13:01"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "naruto820302", "content": "不刷我給尊重，讚", "time": "10/23 13:01"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "kidofking", "content": "這個確實 芮濕背", "time": "10/23 13:01"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "stormNEW", "content": "態度正確", "time": "10/23 13:02"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Kai877", "content": "不意外", "time"